<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Toepfer maize tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Toepfer maize tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus on Monday accepted Toepfer Athens' tender for the supply of 18,000 tonnes of maize at $142.84 per tonne, a statement from the Grain Commission said.</p>
<p>Prices include c and f free out of Limassol port in Cyprus. Shipment is expected in January 1997.</p>
</text>
